WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.339 --> 00:00:13.695
It was summer.

2
00:00:13.717 --> 00:00:18.075
"Our garden looks great," Mom said.

3
00:00:18.129 --> 00:00:22.909
"We'll have lots of vegetables this year!"

4
00:00:22.928 --> 00:00:25.894
Soon the carrots grew.

5
00:00:25.899 --> 00:00:30.180
So did the beans and strawberries.

6
00:00:30.185 --> 00:00:35.310
Then corn and tomatoes started growing.

7
00:00:35.315 --> 00:00:39.334
Every day the family went to the garden.

8
00:00:39.339 --> 00:00:44.516
Every night they ate salad and other vegetables.

9
00:00:44.521 --> 00:00:48.929
They froze some of them.

10
00:00:48.934 --> 00:00:54.964
But there were still more to harvest!

11
00:00:54.971 --> 00:01:00.418
"I'm tired of going to the garden," Harry said.

12
00:01:00.423 --> 00:01:04.616
"Me too," Oliver said.

13
00:01:04.621 --> 00:01:15.237
Dad sighed. "Gardens are a lot of work."

14
00:01:15.242 --> 00:01:22.671
"Mmm!" Mom said. "These vegetables are delicious!"

15
00:01:23.440 --> 00:01:26.687
Everything kept growing.

16
00:01:26.692 --> 00:01:36.314
"What will we do with all of this food?" Oliver asked.

17
00:01:36.319 --> 00:01:39.926
"I know!" Emmy said.

18
00:01:39.931 --> 00:01:43.728
She told everyone her idea.

19
00:01:43.733 --> 00:01:48.696
The kids made a sign.

20
00:01:48.701 --> 00:01:52.593
It said, "Vegetables for sale!

21
00:01:52.598 --> 00:01:54.886
Pick all you can eat!

22
00:01:54.891 --> 00:02:00.021
Pay what you can!"

23
00:02:00.026 --> 00:02:05.554
The kids put the sign outside.

24
00:02:05.559 --> 00:02:08.050
They waited.

25
00:02:08.114 --> 00:02:12.291
Soon people saw the sign.

26
00:02:12.296 --> 00:02:17.871
Lots of people came to the garden.

27
00:02:17.876 --> 00:02:22.222
People picked beans and corn.

28
00:02:22.227 --> 00:02:25.960
They picked tomatoes too.

29
00:02:25.965 --> 00:02:39.394
They put money in a bucket.

30
00:02:39.399 --> 00:02:45.044
"What will we do with the money?" Oliver asked.

31
00:02:45.049 --> 00:02:49.877
"Let's buy a hammock," Dad said.

32
00:02:49.882 --> 00:02:57.273
"Let's go to a baseball game," Harry said.

33
00:02:57.290 --> 00:03:01.364
"I know what to do with the money," Mom said.

34
00:03:01.369 --> 00:03:04.163
"What?" everyone asked.

35
00:03:04.187 --> 00:03:18.770
She smiled. "Buy seeds for next year!"
